+            BRANDING, PRIORITY_SUPPORT);
+
+    /** What every company gets while its status is TRIAL: everything (unlimited WhatsApp, so no cap). */
+    public static final Set<String> DURING_TRIAL = Set.copyOf(ALL.stream()
